# tests/test_catalog.py byte-compares the committed dbt seed against a fresh
# export from src/generator/catalog.py. With core.autocrlf=true (the Windows
# default) git checks the file out with CRLF while the exporter writes LF, so
# the guard would fail on a fresh clone for a reason that has nothing to do
# with the catalog. Pin the seed to LF everywhere.
dbt/seeds/*.csv text eol=lf
